    <string name="about_body">I-BenSuet Stay inceda abafundi boMzantsi Afrika ukufumana indawo yokuhlala ekhuselekileyo neqinisekisiweyo kufutshane nekhampasi yabo, nezinto ze-NSFAS nezokuzixhasa kwindawo enye. Yakhiwe yi-Mansuet Dev.</string>
    <string name="osm_attribution">Imigama isebenzisa idatha yendawo © abanikeli be-OpenStreetMap (Nominatim).</string>
