    <string name="delete_account_confirm_title">Cima i-akhawunti yakho?</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_body">Oku kucima ngokusisigxina iprofayile yakho ye-BenSuet Stay nokungena kwakho. Oku akunakubuyiselwa.</string>
    <string name="account_deleted">I-akhawunti yakho icinyiwe.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">I-BenSuet Stay iqokelela kuphela oko kufunekayo ukudibanisa abafundi neendawo zokuhlala.\n\nEsikuqokelelayo: igama lakho, i-imeyile, idilesi yasekhaya, iziko nohlobo lwenkxaso-mali. Xa ufaka isicelo segumbi sigcina nenombolo yakho yesazisi ye-SA, inombolo yomfundi, ikhampasi, iinkcukacha zesihlobo esikufutshane namagama amaxwebhu owakhethileyo. Kubanini-ndawo: igama, i-imeyile nenombolo yefowuni.\n\nKutheni: ukubonisa iindawo ezifanelekileyo, ukuvumela abanini-ndawo balawule ukujonga nezicelo zakho, nokukuthumelela uhlaziyo ngazo.\n\nNgubani onokukubona: nguwe kuphela, umnini-ndawo wendawo oqhagamshelana nayo, nabalawuli be-BenSuet Stay. Imithetho yokhuseleko yedathabheyisi yethu iyakuqinisekisa oku.\n\nApho kugcinwa khona: kwi-Google Firebase (Cloud Firestore, ummandla waseRhawutini). Iiphasiwedi zilawulwa yi-Firebase Authentication kwaye azigcinwa yi-app.\n\nAmalungelo akho phantsi kwe-POPIA: ungazijonga uze uhlaziye iinkcukacha zakho kwi-Iisetingi, kwaye ucime i-akhawunti yakho nangaliphi na ixesha kwi-Iisetingi → Ubumfihlo → Cima i-akhawunti yam. Ngenye into, sebenzisa Iisetingi → Uncedo → Qhagamshelana nenkxaso.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q1">Ndibhukisha njani ukujonga indawo?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a1">Vula isibhengezo uze ucofe u-Bhukisha ukujonga, emva koko ukhethe umhla nexesha. Umnini-ndawo uyakuqinisekisa okanye akwale, kwaye ufumana isaziso nakweyiphi na imeko.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q2">Ndisifaka njani isicelo segumbi?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a2">Vula isibhengezo, khetha uhlobo lwegumbi uze ucofe u-Khetha igumbi. Abafundi be-NSFAS baqinisekisa iinkcukacha zabo ze-NSFAS; abazixhasayo bongeza iinkcukacha zesihlobo esikufutshane namaxwebhu abo. Silandele kwi-Iisetingi → Izicelo zam.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q3">Ndingayisebenzisa i-app ngaphandle kwe-intanethi?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a3">Ewe. Izibhengezo osele uzivulile zihlala zibonakala, kwaye izicelo zokujonga okanye izicelo ozenze ungekho kwi-intanethi zigcinwa kwifowuni yakho zize zithunyelwe ngokuzenzekelayo xa uphinda uqhagamshela.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q4">Kutheni ndingaboni zonke iindawo zokuhlala?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a4">Ikhasi lasekhaya liqala ngohlobo lwakho lwenkxaso-mali kwaye u-Kufutshane nekhampasi yam uvuliwe. Cofa u-Zonke okanye u-Kufutshane nekhampasi yam ukwandisa ukukhangela, okanye utshintshe oku kwi-Iisetingi → Iskrini sasekhaya.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q1">Ngubani owenza aze ahlele izibhengezo zam?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a1">Iqela labalawuli be-BenSuet Stay lenza izibhengezo lize likunike zona. Ukutshintsha isibhengezo okanye iinkcukacha zakho, sebenzisa u-Qhagamshelana nenkxaso, okanye u-Cela utshintsho phantsi kwe-Iinkcukacha zakho.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q2">Ndizilawula njani izicelo zokujonga?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a2">Vula u-Ubhukisho uze uqinisekise okanye wale isicelo ngasinye. Xa usala, nika isizathu uze ucebise elinye ixesha. Umfundi uyaziswa ngoko nangoko.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q3">Kwenzeka ntoni xa ndivuma isicelo?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a3">Indawo enye isuswa kolo hlobo lwegumbi ngokuzenzekelayo, kwaye umfundi ubona inqaku lakho phantsi kwe-Izicelo zam.</string>
</resources>
